-- Page-first refactor, step 4: retire the lesson-hierarchy POC pipeline.
--
-- book_lessons (lesson_number/unit/order_index/content.sections[].blocks[])
-- assumed a fixed chapter/lesson/section structure that the page-first model
-- explicitly rejects — the page is the only content unit now. Nothing in the
-- app reads or writes book_lessons any more after the page-first refactor.
--
-- This was originally written as a straight `drop table`, on the (at the
-- time correct) assumption that book_lessons only held cleaned POC content.
-- It now holds real production data (13 rows, generated by a real extraction
-- run against a real textbook) — dropping it would destroy that. Archive
-- instead: fully removed from every code path, fully recoverable.
alter table if exists public.book_lessons rename to book_lessons_archived;
